@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Liste — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/students

### Étudiant — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/1

### Introuvable — 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/999

### Création — 201 (une seule fois par redémarrage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Alice","lastName":"Dupont","email":"alice@example.com","grade":14,"field":"informatique"}

### Email manquant — 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Alice","lastName":"Dupont","grade":14,"field":"informatique"}

### Email déjà utilisé — 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Alice","lastName":"Dupont","email":"ahmed@example.com","grade":14,"field":"informatique"}

### Modification — 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"firstName":"Ahmed","lastName":"Ben Ali","email":"ahmed@example.com","grade":19,"field":"informatique"}

### Statistiques — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/stats

### Recherche — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/students/search?q=ahmed

### Suppression — 200 (à faire après la recherche)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/students/1
